   "updated": 1764000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "EVERY PIECE CARRIES A LABEL\n\nTitle line:  \"Budget.xlsx > sheet Q1 > rows 1-50\"\nWhere:  team, chat, file, page / slide / sheet / minute\nWho wrote it, and when (last changed)\nWho may see it  (used by the privacy filter)\nA link back to the exact spot in Teams\n\nSize: about 300-800 tokens (roughly 200-600 words),\nsmall enough to be precise, big enough to make sense",
   "originalText": "EVERY PIECE CARRIES A LABEL\n\nTitle line:  \"Budget.xlsx > sheet Q1 > rows 1-50\"\nWhere:  team, chat, file, page / slide / sheet / minute\nWho wrote it, and when (last changed)\nWho may see it  (used by the privacy filter)\nA link back to the exact spot in Teams\n\nSize: about 300-800 tokens (roughly 200-600 words),\nsmall enough to be precise, big enough to make sense",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
