   "updated": 1764000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "WHY THIS MATTERS\n\nAnswers can point to the exact spot:\n\"[meeting 17 Nov, 32:10]\"  \"[Budget.xlsx, sheet Q1]\"\n\nOnly the changed piece is redone when something is edited\n(Part 2), so updates stay fast and cheap.\n\nMax's own meeting notes are pieces too,\nso past meetings are easy to find.",
   "originalText": "WHY THIS MATTERS\n\nAnswers can point to the exact spot:\n\"[meeting 17 Nov, 32:10]\"  \"[Budget.xlsx, sheet Q1]\"\n\nOnly the changed piece is redone when something is edited\n(Part 2), so updates stay fast and cheap.\n\nMax's own meeting notes are pieces too,\nso past meetings are easy to find.",
